### 1.2 Critical Architecture Flaws

| # | Flaw | Tables Affected | Impact |
|---|------|----------------|--------|
| 1 | **Triple-write for applications** — `job_applications`, `candidate_applications`, `candidates` all written to independently without transaction | 3 tables | Data drift, count divergence |
| 2 | **Dual job definition** — `job_forms` and `recruitment_posts` are independent tables for the same concept | 2 tables | Orphaned postings, broken links |
| 3 | **Global candidate stage** — `candidates.stage` is overwritten globally instead of per-application | 1 table | Multi-job candidates lose status |
| 4 | **FK column name split-brain** — Same FK called `form_id` in some contexts, `job_form_id` in others | 4 tables | Silent query failures, empty results |
| 5 | **Assessment questions contain answers** — `assessments.questions` JSONB includes `correctAnswer` | 1 table | Answer leakage (no RLS) |
| 6 | **Performance data as JSONB array** — `profiles.performance_history` is an unbounded array | 1 table | 1NF violation, no queryability |
| 7 | **Zero RLS policies** — All 37 tables queryable by any authenticated user | 37 tables | Full data breach exposure |
| 8 | **No audit trail** — Only `salary_revision_history` tracks changes | 36 tables | No compliance capability |

### 1.3 Table Ownership Audit

| Table | Should Own | Currently Also Stores | Fix |
|-------|-----------|----------------------|-----|
| `candidates` | Candidate identity (name, email, phone, resume) | `stage`, `ats_score`, `recommendation` | Remove — these are per-application |
| `job_applications` | Raw form submission (answers, resume_url) | `candidate_name`, `candidate_email` | Remove — denormalized data |
| `candidate_applications` | Pipeline tracking (status, scores) | `parsed_resume_text` | Move to candidates or separate table |
| `profiles` | User identity + employment details | `payroll_ctc`, `performance_score`, `performance_history` | Move to payroll_records and performance_reviews |
| `assessments` | Test definition (title, config, time limit) | `questions` with `correctAnswer` embedded | Separate answer keys to server-only table |
| `interview_sessions` | Interview record | All scores + feedback in one row | Normalize feedback to separate table for panel support |

