### 3.3 Form Versioning Strategy

```
When HR modifies a job posting's form_schema:
  1. Increment form_version
  2. Store snapshot in form_version_history JSONB column OR separate table
  3. Every application records the form_version at submission time
  4. Historical applications render using their frozen schema version
  
This ensures: editing a form NEVER changes how past applications display.
```

