        integer communication_score "0-100"
        integer problem_solving_score "0-100"
        integer culture_fit_score "0-100"
        integer overall_score "0-100"
        text recommendation "CHECK: strong_hire|hire|no_hire|strong_no_hire"
        text strengths
        text weaknesses
        text detailed_feedback
        boolean is_submitted "DEFAULT false — becomes immutable when true"
        timestamptz submitted_at
        timestamptz created_at
    }
```

### 6.2 Interview Workflow Rules

```
SCHEDULING:
  Round N cannot be scheduled until Round N-1 status = 'completed'
  Enforced by: DB trigger on interview_rounds INSERT
  
FEEDBACK:
  Each round can have 1-5 interviewers (panel support)
  Each interviewer submits independent feedback
  Feedback is IMMUTABLE after is_submitted = true
  Enforced by: UPDATE trigger — reject if is_submitted was already true
  
SCORING:
  interview_rounds.overall_score = AVG(interview_feedback.overall_score)
  Computed by: trigger on interview_feedback INSERT/UPDATE
  
RECOMMENDATION:
  interview_rounds.overall_recommendation = majority vote of feedback recommendations
  If unanimous strong_hire → strong_hire
  If majority hire → hire
  If any strong_no_hire → strong_no_hire
  Otherwise → no_hire
  
STAGE PROGRESSION:
  All rounds completed + final round = hire → applications.stage = 'offer_pending'
  Any round = strong_no_hire → applications.stage = 'rejected'
```

### 6.3 What This Replaces

| Current | Enterprise Target |
|---------|------------------|
| `interview_sessions` (single table, no interviewer) | `interview_rounds` + `interview_feedback` (normalized) |
| AI-generated scores | **REMOVED** — Human interviewers submit scores |
| All scores visible to candidates | RLS: candidates see round `status` only, not scores/feedback |
| Free-text `round_name` | `round_number` INTEGER + `round_type` CHECK |
| Feedback mutable forever | `is_submitted` flag → immutable after submission |
| No no-show tracking | `no_show` status on interview_rounds |

