  employment_status     TEXT CHECK (active|probation|pip|notice_period|suspended|terminated|resigned)
  date_of_joining       DATE
  date_of_birth         DATE
  probation_end_date    DATE
  avatar_url            TEXT
  created_at            TIMESTAMPTZ
  updated_at            TIMESTAMPTZ

REMOVED from profiles:
  ❌ payroll_ctc          → payroll_records table
  ❌ performance_score    → performance_reviews table
  ❌ performance_history  → performance_reviews table
  ❌ education            → candidates.parsed_resume_data OR employee_documents
  ❌ experience           → candidates.parsed_resume_data
  ❌ core_skills          → candidates.parsed_resume_data
  ❌ department (string)  → department_id FK
```

### 8.2 Organizational Hierarchy

```
Company
  └── Departments (departments table)
       └── Teams (implicit via reporting_manager_id)
            └── Employees (profiles WHERE role = 'employee')

Hierarchy query:
  WITH RECURSIVE org_tree AS (
    SELECT id, full_name, reporting_manager_id, 0 as depth
    FROM profiles WHERE reporting_manager_id IS NULL AND role != 'candidate'
    UNION ALL
    SELECT p.id, p.full_name, p.reporting_manager_id, ot.depth + 1
    FROM profiles p JOIN org_tree ot ON p.reporting_manager_id = ot.id
  )
  SELECT * FROM org_tree ORDER BY depth, full_name;
```

