## 13. SEARCH OPTIMIZATION PLAN

### 13.1 Full-Text Search Setup

```
Enable pg_trgm extension:
  CREATE EXTENSION IF NOT EXISTS pg_trgm;

Candidate name search (fuzzy):
  CREATE INDEX idx_candidates_name_trgm ON candidates USING GIN (full_name gin_trgm_ops);
  
  Query: SELECT * FROM candidates 
         WHERE full_name % 'John Doe' 
         ORDER BY similarity(full_name, 'John Doe') DESC
         LIMIT 20;

Candidate email search (exact prefix):
  CREATE INDEX idx_candidates_email_trgm ON candidates USING GIN (email gin_trgm_ops);

Job title search:
  CREATE INDEX idx_postings_title_trgm ON job_postings USING GIN (jd_text gin_trgm_ops);
```

