## 17. MIGRATION STRATEGY

### 17.1 Zero-Downtime Migration Approach

```
Phase 1: ADDITIVE — Create new tables and columns alongside existing ones
Phase 2: DUAL-WRITE — Frontend writes to BOTH old and new tables
Phase 3: BACKFILL — Migrate historical data from old tables to new
Phase 4: CUTOVER — Frontend reads from new tables only
Phase 5: CLEANUP — Drop old tables after verification period

This ensures: No data loss, no downtime, rollback possible at every phase.
```

### 17.2 Migration Execution Order

