### 17.3 Rollback Strategy

```
Every migration has a rollback script:
  M5 rollback: Rename job_postings → job_forms, drop added columns
  M8 rollback: Recreate job_applications from applications backup
  M25 rollback: DROP all RLS policies (tables remain functional)
  M27 rollback: Restore old tables from backup (taken before drop)

Backup protocol:
  Before M8-M9: pg_dump of job_applications + candidate_applications
  Before M27: pg_dump of all tables being dropped
  Retention: 90 days
```

