### 18.2 Critical Risk Mitigations

| Risk | Probability | Impact | Mitigation |
|------|------------|--------|-----------|
| Application data lost during M8-M9 | Medium | Critical | Full pg_dump before migration + row-count verification after |
| RLS policies break existing queries | High | Critical | Test in Supabase branch/staging first; deploy per-table |
| Dual-write period causes divergence | Medium | High | Add reconciliation check query; run every 6 hours |
| form_id → job_posting_id rename breaks reads | High | High | Add column alias in same transaction as rename |
| Department string normalization misses variations | High | Medium | Manual review of DISTINCT values before migration |

